WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The plan opens in a buffer beside the session

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.400
In the plan buffer, C-c C-a puts a comment on a line

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.100
C-c C-p chooses the permission mode to approve with

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.900
C-c C-c sends the plan back with the comment
